ant x column after eviction | Minor | **Fixed** | The store drops `positions` when all retained positions are represented by point x values again. [store-unaligned.ts:195](/home/canarit/projects/axylo/packages/axylo/src/data/store-unaligned.ts:195) | “Drops the scatter x positions column once every retained row is a point again.” Fixture for retained x and an implementation-specific buffer check consistent with P7. [streaming-storage.test.ts:817](/home/canarit/projects/axylo/packages/axylo/test/data/streaming-storage.test.ts:817) |\n    45\t\n    46\t## Table 2. Regressions introduced since `bbd7564`\n    47\t\n    48\t| Severity | Sequence | Wrong result | Smallest fix |\n    49\t|---|---|---|---|\n    50\t| **R1 · Blocker** | Pin Q3 in Q1–Q4. Press its row, append Q5 with `keep: 4`, then release over the surviving Q3 button. | Release selects **Q4**. The handler uses Q3’s old numeric category index. Its one-second suppression also swallows unrelated keyboard clicks. [tooltip.ts:150](/home/canarit/projects/axylo/packages/axylo/src/dom/tooltip.ts:150), [tooltip.ts:216](/home/canarit/projects/axylo/packages/axylo/src/dom/tooltip.ts:216), [interaction.ts:1942](/home/canarit/projects/axylo/packages/axylo/src/dom/interaction.ts:1942) | Capture the semantic row identity, resolve its current ref on release, and suppress only the matching pointer click. |\n    51\t| **R2 · Blocker** | Create A first in a shadow root. Pin A, hover B without moving focus, then press Escape. | B spends Escape while focus is inside A. The ownership check sees A’s host. The drag branch can spend the key before checking ownership at all. [interaction.ts:1525](/home/canarit/projects/axylo/packages/axylo/src/dom/interaction.ts:1525) | Resolve the focused chart through the composed tree before any branch spends Escape. |\n    52\t| **R3 · Major** | At DPR 1, pin the centre pick of the 32,000-point ring and press `+6 more`. | The winning group has 14 rows. All six shown on page two belong to another